These fixtures are copied without modification from MimeKit's committed
UnitTests/TestData corpus at dd2c6f10. See LICENSE for its MIT license.

The selection matches MimeParserTests.RoundTripMessageFiles:
  messages/*.eml and messages/*.txt
  compliance/*.eml
  partial/*.eml
  openpgp/*.eml
  dkim/*.msg
  smime/*-signed.txt

Only committed fixtures are included (68 files). Local MimeReader changes,
diagnostic-location changes, and the untracked 80k-participants.eml fixture
are not imported.

test-roundtrip checks exact original bytes using both memory-backed and
source-backed content. As in MimeKit, it omits a leading UTF-8 BOM from
the expected serialization and restores an initial mbox marker.
